{"id":107568930641129,"name":"Robotomy Corporation VANITIES [v1.8.5] ","desc":"🔨 Shutdown = Update/Bug Fixes\nIf you find any bugs, please report them to the community!\n\nNew Icon was made by @lolkek, thank you for submitting art!\n\nWelcome to Robotomy Corporation \n\nYour job here is to manage abnormalities and to collect energy.\nDeath is not an end to your work. There is no living in here. Good luck.\n\nWhat you can do in this game:\n- 📝 Start working on abnormalities and start getting PE-Boxes to meet the energy quota! \n- ⚔️ Suppress abnormalities and bring them back to their containment!\n- ❤️ Assist your team members and start working as a team\n- 👨‍💼 Be a manager and use your iron fist to run the company.\n\nControls:\nTab - View stats\nMouse Scroll - Zoom camera\nClick on Containment Door - Work with abnormalities\nR - Special for certain weapons\n\nThis game is largely inspired by Lobotomy Corporation. \n\nA remake is being worked on. This game will have a final update on v2.0.\n\nTags:\nLobotomy Corporation, SCP, Abnormality, Manager, Library of Ruina","path":"/game/107568930641129-robotomy-corporation-vanities","slug":"107568930641129-robotomy-corporation-vanities","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/90b912bf2a77f0e6845e7ec42e33c0b60736a7e7cedaba9133fb08830ca39e98.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8ebfd33e552eb03190c4a0ab8973d345/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":19,"visitor":7175526,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-06-24T16:56:22.999Z","creator":{"name":"Moonlight Wing","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"_id":"6a3c0c36a3862145bd307107","title":"Script Request","game":{"_id":"6a3c0c36a3862145bd307106","gameId":107568930641129,"name":"Robotomy Corporation VANITIES [v1.8.5] ","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9f5fe89c0ef70cc322c2df5e23d8caa4750fd933e3dbf59fac2bc86f96919990.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/rbx-b